pping</a>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <div class=\"redline\"></div>\r\n                        <div class=\"teaser\">\r\n                            <p>This service allows you to send any e-shop items from any online store to Georgia. Together with our partner website we offer lots of shops, with coupon codes, promotions and cash back (some exceptions exist).</p>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <div class=\"more-block\">\r\n                            <a href=\"\" class=\"more\"></a>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"img\">\r\n                            <a href=\"\"><img src=\"https://www.gzavnili.com/include/pages/files/ge/service-4.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <div class=\"title\">\r\n                            <a href=\"\">Courier Service</a>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <div class=\"redline\"></div>\r\n                        <div class=\"teaser\">\r\n                            <p>We offer a collection of parcels in three ways: to bring package to the office, If you're looking for save a time and money; Our Courier will collect from your home or office or send us with any postal service.</p>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <div class=\"more-block\">\r\n                            <a href=\"\" class=\"more\"></a>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"img\">\r\n                            <a href=\"\"><img src=\"https://www.gzavnili.com/include/pages/files/ge/Cargo_Services.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <div class=\"title\">\r\n                            <a href=\"\">Cargo Shipping</a>\r\n                        </div>